OL,3,GNEWSACouncil injunction to ban
OL,4,Aactivists putting flags up
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham City Council is seeking a
OL,7,FHigh Court injunction to stop members
OL,8,Fof anti-migrant group Raise the Colours
OL,9,Ffrom putting flags up in the city.
OL,11,FThe authority said the action followed
OL,12,Fan "evidence-led process" which was
OL,13,Ffocused on public safety, lawful
OL,14,Fhighway management and community
OL,15,Fcohesion.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
