OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil injunction to ban
OL,4,Aactivists putting flags up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Birmingham-based group has been
OL,7,Factively putting up Union and St
OL,8,FGeorge's Cross flags on lampposts in
OL,9,Fseveral suburbs, leading to angry
OL,10,Fclashes with opposing groups and
OL,11,Fresidents who claimed their actions
OL,12,Fwere divisive rather than patriotic.
OL,14,FThe injunction names organiser Ryan
OL,15,FBridge and six others as well as
OL,16,F"persons unknown". If successful, it
OL,17,Fwould prevent anyone hanging flags.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
